## Upstream weights

The `bitnet700m.nanow` container in this repository is a re-formatting of the
BitNet b1.58 700M checkpoint, and the masks, tokenizer and configuration are
derived from:

    https://huggingface.co/1bitLLM/bitnet_b1_58-large

That checkpoint is published under the MIT License by the 1bitLLM project. It is
a reproduction of "The Era of 1-bit LLMs: All Large Language Models are in 1.58
Bits" (arXiv:2402.17764), trained on the RedPajama dataset for 100B tokens.

The upstream license and attribution are preserved here. No new training was
performed for this release; the numerical weights are unmodified apart from being
quantized to ternary and repacked, which is what the upstream checkpoint does at
load time anyway.

